<title>USA: Big B says Revco offer unsolicited.</title>
<headline>Big B says Revco offer unsolicited.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Big B Inc said on Monday the cash tender offer by Revco D.S. Inc for all the outstanding shares of the company was unsolicited.</p>
<p>Anthony Bruno, chairman of the board, said the company would &quot;carefully consider&quot; the Revco offer to pay $15 per share for Big B shares.</p>
<p>Big B said it  asked its stockholders to defer making a decision on the offer until they are advised of the board's position.</p>
</text>
